WEBVTT

00:00:16.590 --> 00:00:17.690
Is that so?

00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:21.150
You had a scary dream of a rhinoceros beetle,

00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:23.710
and are still half asleep, aren't you?

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:28.380
Please, rest easy. Everything 
will be okay, Master.

00:00:28.620 --> 00:00:30.860
Okay my butt!

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.380
See what I mean?!

00:02:22.990 --> 00:02:28.000
<b>What Are the 6 Holy Knights?</b>

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:34.840
Ew... What's with that?

00:02:34.840 --> 00:02:36.600
Ishiyama sure is scary...

00:02:36.600 --> 00:02:38.170
Shh! Don't look...

00:02:38.170 --> 00:02:40.000
Give us a break...

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:41.800
I wished they'd get lost, seriously.

00:02:43.800 --> 00:02:47.310
Yeah, definitely gotta 
pawn him off onto someone.

00:02:47.310 --> 00:02:50.990
Sure, but even the TKKH couldn't cut it.

00:02:50.990 --> 00:02:54.590
You really think there's someone strong 
enough for Baby Beel at this school?

00:02:54.820 --> 00:02:56.560
No kidding...

00:02:58.030 --> 00:03:02.320
I had a bit higher expectations for people 
from a top-class delinquent school.

00:03:06.300 --> 00:03:08.860
But you were surprisingly trivial to defeat.

00:03:08.860 --> 00:03:10.320
What a disappointment!

00:03:11.600 --> 00:03:13.460
They're just the small fry.

00:03:14.240 --> 00:03:17.590
Are you saying I should expect 
better from this Oga-kun fellow?

00:03:17.590 --> 00:03:21.760
Yes... I'm looking forward 
to meeting him myself.

00:03:21.760 --> 00:03:24.030
Isn't that right, Oga?

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:27.970
<b>Self Study</b>

00:03:28.380 --> 00:03:30.780
Uh, are we missing people?

00:03:30.780 --> 00:03:32.130
Really?

00:03:32.130 --> 00:03:35.610
Look... The MK5 and Good Night aren't here.

00:03:35.610 --> 00:03:37.290
Aren't they just cutting class?

00:03:37.290 --> 00:03:39.190
I've heard some odd rumors...

00:03:39.190 --> 00:03:44.200
Some so-called shadowy guardians of this 
school have started making their move...

00:03:44.200 --> 00:03:46.080
Shadowy guardians?

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:47.520
The 6 Holy Knights.

00:03:47.790 --> 00:03:49.480
I heard the rumor, too...

00:03:49.480 --> 00:03:53.040
They're trying to drive out 
all the Ishiyama students.

00:03:54.030 --> 00:04:00.300
Yeah, but I can't imagine this school havin' 
anyone stronger than you, Madame Aoi.

00:04:00.300 --> 00:04:02.660
I wouldn't say that.

00:04:02.660 --> 00:04:03.960
Seriously?!

00:04:03.960 --> 00:04:06.300
The extracurricular activities 
thrive at this school, yes?

00:04:06.300 --> 00:04:08.090
6 people are chosen each year.

00:04:08.090 --> 00:04:12.320
Experts in all kinds of physical 
competition, with superior grades to match.

00:04:12.320 --> 00:04:16.090
They enforce the traditions and 
public morals of the school.

00:04:17.560 --> 00:04:21.370
Then, were the MK5 and the 
others done in by them?

00:04:22.060 --> 00:04:23.610
What're you so scared of?

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:29.370
Even if that's true, the MK5 and 
Good Morning are just chumps.

00:04:30.620 --> 00:04:33.410
And you're now suddenly afraid?

00:04:33.410 --> 00:04:36.630
What was that? When did I give 
you permission to butt in?

00:04:36.630 --> 00:04:40.410
Or are you just begging for 
a little attention, huh?

00:04:40.410 --> 00:04:42.650
Hands off me, you stupid bitch.

00:04:42.650 --> 00:04:44.510
Who're you callin' a stupid bitch?!

00:04:44.510 --> 00:04:45.880
Enough, you two!

00:04:48.140 --> 00:04:50.680
I-I apologize, Madame...

00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:54.940
Hmm, yeah, I guess so...

00:04:56.180 --> 00:04:57.900
What're you muttering about?

00:04:57.900 --> 00:04:59.000
I see...

00:04:59.350 --> 00:05:00.770
An idiot won't do.

00:05:01.150 --> 00:05:02.320
What're you talking about?

00:05:02.580 --> 00:05:07.420
Forgetting something, are we? I'm talking 
about dumping Baby Beel off on someone.

00:05:07.870 --> 00:05:10.160
Idiots aren't going to cut it!

00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:12.160
Him! And him!

00:05:13.390 --> 00:05:14.410
Me?

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:17.220
Yeah! Not even close!

00:05:17.220 --> 00:05:20.960
I'm sorry... He's kind of 
like, on edge right now...

00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:24.300
Which means my goal is set!

00:05:24.760 --> 00:05:28.130
I'm gonna find these 6 Holy Knight 
people who're smarter than me!

00:05:28.430 --> 00:05:30.680
Smarter than him?

00:05:30.680 --> 00:05:32.800
I think we're all smarter than him...

00:05:33.960 --> 00:05:38.190
Kunieda and Oga from Ishiyama 
High's Special Class...

00:05:38.190 --> 00:05:40.710
Please come immediately 
to the Counselor's Office.

00:05:41.100 --> 00:05:41.880
Huh?

00:05:41.880 --> 00:05:43.110
That voice...

00:05:48.820 --> 00:05:52.270
If I'm not mistaken, you 
promised the other day...

00:05:52.520 --> 00:05:54.120
Huh? Promised what again?

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:57.450
You know, that... the Ishiyama 
Reformation Project.

00:05:57.450 --> 00:06:03.310
But as usual, all you people do 
is cause trouble in the school.

00:06:03.310 --> 00:06:07.630
Just look at Sadohara-sensei... 
He's turned into a basket case.

00:06:08.250 --> 00:06:11.910
M-My beloved ride... 10-year loan...

00:06:11.910 --> 00:06:14.460
10 years... Car destroyed...

00:06:15.600 --> 00:06:20.480
And this... I've been wondering 
from the start, but that baby...

00:06:23.160 --> 00:06:27.630
Because you've been walking 
around with a naked baby,

00:06:27.630 --> 00:06:30.600
many of the girl students are upset.

00:06:30.600 --> 00:06:32.780
Could you at least put some clothes on him?

00:06:32.780 --> 00:06:37.040
U-Um, if I may, is there some
 school rule regarding...?

00:06:38.410 --> 00:06:40.380
Sorry, but there is.

00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:42.920
<b>School Rule
You Cannot Be Fully Naked</b>

00:06:46.550 --> 00:06:48.920
W-Well, anyway...

00:06:48.920 --> 00:06:52.550
At this rate we are going to have 
to take more extreme measures.

00:06:52.550 --> 00:06:54.180
Extreme measures?

00:06:54.180 --> 00:07:00.440
I'm saying there are people in this school 
who have the power to completely dominate you.

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:03.060
Oh yeah... Those 6 Holy Knight folks?

00:07:03.060 --> 00:07:05.480
H-How do you know that name?

00:07:05.480 --> 00:07:07.850
Perfect! I wanted to meet them.

00:07:07.850 --> 00:07:09.240
Where are they?

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:12.340
Wait... You... want to meet them?

00:07:13.410 --> 00:07:15.620
So frightful! The 6 Holy Knights!

00:07:15.620 --> 00:07:19.430
The 6 Holy Knights... The 
6 Holy Knights are coming!

00:07:19.430 --> 00:07:22.120
Plus, my 10-year loan!!

00:07:22.120 --> 00:07:25.420
Sadohara-sensei, please 
get a hold of yourself.

00:07:27.880 --> 00:07:31.250
Honestly, what's with these 
6 Holy Knight people?

00:07:31.250 --> 00:07:33.250
Maybe Kazu knows?

00:07:34.800 --> 00:07:37.390
I'll go ask him.

00:07:38.600 --> 00:07:42.140
Go ask him? H-Hey, wait!

00:07:46.010 --> 00:07:48.790
Oga and the Queen got called out...

00:07:49.230 --> 00:07:51.530
I can't stand being in that classroom...

00:07:51.530 --> 00:07:53.250
Nowhere for me to go...

00:07:53.250 --> 00:07:54.530
Furuichi-kun.

00:07:55.780 --> 00:07:56.820
How's it been?

00:07:57.150 --> 00:07:58.800
Do you remember me?

00:07:59.560 --> 00:08:02.190
You're... Miki!

00:08:02.410 --> 00:08:03.930
Alone?

00:08:03.930 --> 00:08:06.170
I thought Oga-kun would be with you...

00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:10.280
Oh, Miki! It's you, Miki!

00:08:10.280 --> 00:08:11.720
Long time no see!

00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:15.170
I see... So, you went to this high school?

00:08:15.170 --> 00:08:18.730
You seem like a different person, 
I didn't recognize you at first.

00:08:18.990 --> 00:08:21.200
Last time we met was in middle school, right?

00:08:22.490 --> 00:08:25.120
I see that you people haven't changed.

00:08:25.120 --> 00:08:27.260
I hear you destroyed the school building?

00:08:27.260 --> 00:08:30.050
Yeah, well... That wasn't me.

00:08:30.050 --> 00:08:34.340
Man, just being with them gets 
me treated like a criminal.

00:08:34.680 --> 00:08:37.180
Well, you two are always together.

00:08:37.410 --> 00:08:40.850
But... You've sure changed.

00:08:40.850 --> 00:08:41.620
I have?

00:08:41.620 --> 00:08:46.250
You were a lot more sheepish back 
then. I bet you're popular now.

00:08:46.250 --> 00:08:47.790
No. Not at all.

00:08:47.790 --> 00:08:49.250
Oh, come on now.

00:08:49.250 --> 00:08:51.130
I bet you're a hit with the ladies.

00:08:51.130 --> 00:08:53.250
Introduce me to some cuties, would ya?

00:08:54.550 --> 00:08:56.200
And you haven't changed one bit.

00:08:56.200 --> 00:08:59.720
Well, I'm just glad I know someone here.

00:08:59.720 --> 00:09:03.550
Honestly the cold shoulder I'm 
getting at this school is damn harsh.

00:09:03.550 --> 00:09:06.550
We're allergic to delinquents.

00:09:06.550 --> 00:09:09.450
Yeah, but I'm not a delinquent, see...

00:09:10.640 --> 00:09:13.820
That's true! But, I'll warn you...

00:09:14.070 --> 00:09:18.200
Their sights are now firmly set on you people.

00:09:18.800 --> 00:09:19.550
Huh?

00:09:19.830 --> 00:09:23.230
It's not about who's stronger...

00:09:23.230 --> 00:09:25.680
You'll lose the moment you 
actually start to fight.

00:09:25.930 --> 00:09:27.830
That's what I wanted to tell you.

00:09:27.830 --> 00:09:31.640
H-Hey, what? What're you...

00:09:31.640 --> 00:09:32.710
Who do you mean, "they"?

00:09:34.450 --> 00:09:35.720
The 6 Holy Knights.

00:09:36.970 --> 00:09:40.580
You must not fight them, no matter what.

00:09:53.540 --> 00:09:57.580
Man, it's so suffocating 
in the school recently.

00:09:57.580 --> 00:10:01.770
Yeah. It's all 'cause that bunch 
transferred in from Ishiyama High.

00:10:01.770 --> 00:10:05.000
Seriously, it's more like they're 
from Oh, shit!-yama than Ishiyama...

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:07.750
Huh? But they're nice people!

00:10:09.670 --> 00:10:11.780
Azusa, don't tell me...

00:10:11.780 --> 00:10:14.630
Yup! I'm pretty good friends with them!

00:10:15.240 --> 00:10:17.540
We went and ate cake together, for example.

00:10:17.540 --> 00:10:21.820
You seriously need to get 
some sense of danger!

00:10:21.820 --> 00:10:24.260
If you don't, you'll 
be on the road to disaster!

00:10:24.260 --> 00:10:26.210
That's right! Men are wolves!

00:10:26.210 --> 00:10:28.060
Especially the ones from O-shi-yama!

00:10:28.060 --> 00:10:30.890
Remember what happened 
with the physicals?

00:10:30.890 --> 00:10:37.930
I heard the guy with the baby peeped 
at the girls when they were changing!

00:10:37.930 --> 00:10:40.610
Oh, that's Oga-san!

00:10:40.610 --> 00:10:41.470
Oga-san?

00:10:41.470 --> 00:10:46.730
Is he the one that has a naked baby on 
his back for some reason, like this?

00:10:49.150 --> 00:10:50.250
They're here!

00:10:50.250 --> 00:10:52.050
O-shi-yama!

00:10:52.050 --> 00:10:54.090
Oh, it's Oga-san!

00:10:54.090 --> 00:10:55.350
Wazzap!

00:10:55.350 --> 00:10:56.530
Wazzap.

00:10:58.400 --> 00:10:59.950
The strongest from O-shi-yama...

00:10:59.950 --> 00:11:01.590
Don't make eye-contact.

00:11:01.590 --> 00:11:03.180
Kazu around?

00:11:03.460 --> 00:11:05.770
He's in the bathroom right now!

00:11:05.770 --> 00:11:07.250
He's taking a while, so he's probably...

00:11:07.250 --> 00:11:09.200
Azusa, don't say it!

00:11:09.200 --> 00:11:10.560
You want to get pregnant?!

00:11:10.560 --> 00:11:14.800
Come on... The teachers told 
us not to come over here.

00:11:14.800 --> 00:11:15.650
Let's go.

00:11:16.360 --> 00:11:19.140
You're here too, Kunieda-senpai?

00:11:19.140 --> 00:11:21.530
Hello! On a date?

00:11:25.600 --> 00:11:27.370
D-D-D-Date?!

00:11:27.640 --> 00:11:31.800
N-No way! I-I mean, we're at school!

00:11:31.800 --> 00:11:33.560
Come on, let's go already!

00:11:33.560 --> 00:11:36.120
Actually, I wanted to ask him something.

00:11:37.340 --> 00:11:38.140
See, this guy...

00:11:39.180 --> 00:11:44.320
I have a feeling he'd take a liking to 
someone that's stronger and smarter than me.

00:11:44.650 --> 00:11:47.520
I was hoping they could 
look after him instead.

00:11:47.520 --> 00:11:48.310
So I'm looking for them.

00:11:48.310 --> 00:11:51.080
Looking for them? For who?

00:11:51.540 --> 00:11:53.060
These 6 Holy Knight people.

00:11:54.850 --> 00:11:56.120
It's all over...

00:11:56.120 --> 00:11:57.960
Just by saying their name...

00:11:57.960 --> 00:11:59.590
He's dead meat!

00:11:59.590 --> 00:12:01.060
Holy shit, indeed!

00:12:04.820 --> 00:12:07.990
I do hope you put up more of 
a fight than those others.

00:12:18.880 --> 00:12:21.820
What do you mean by that?

00:12:21.820 --> 00:12:23.900
Don't fight with the 6 Holy Knights?

00:12:23.900 --> 00:12:27.730
It means exactly what it 
means. Tell Oga for me.

00:12:27.730 --> 00:12:29.560
W-Wait a sec!

00:12:29.560 --> 00:12:32.710
Who are these 6 Holy Knight people anyway?

00:12:32.710 --> 00:12:34.770
Do they have some special 
feature or something?

00:12:35.780 --> 00:12:37.050
The Emblem.

00:12:37.050 --> 00:12:38.260
Emblem.

00:12:38.650 --> 00:12:44.280
On the collar of their uniform, they 
wear an Emblem in the shape of a lion.

00:12:44.280 --> 00:12:47.360
You mean, like that school badge you wear?

00:12:47.360 --> 00:12:48.670
Oh, this?

00:12:49.160 --> 00:12:54.450
You might not be able to tell, since 
it's usually worn on the underside.

00:12:59.090 --> 00:13:00.720
Y-You're...

00:13:00.720 --> 00:13:03.250
Anyway, I've warned you.

00:13:03.890 --> 00:13:05.430
Hey, Miki!

00:13:07.930 --> 00:13:10.290
Man, what a load off!

00:13:10.290 --> 00:13:13.610
Delinquents like me gotta 
take dumps at school, yup!

00:13:26.570 --> 00:13:29.840
Perhaps I shall start again 
and introduce myself.

00:13:30.950 --> 00:13:36.120
How do you do? I am St. Ishiyama's 
Captains' Union Boxing Club Captain,

00:13:36.120 --> 00:13:39.510
and one of the 6 Holy Knights,

00:13:39.510 --> 00:13:41.210
Shinjo Alex.

00:13:46.860 --> 00:13:48.370
Sakaki-kun,

00:13:48.370 --> 00:13:51.330
don't you have any sense of cooperation here?

00:13:51.330 --> 00:13:54.560
Now I look like an idiot, being 
the only one to give his name!

00:13:54.810 --> 00:13:58.110
Come on, tell them your name! Who are you?!

00:14:01.270 --> 00:14:02.450
Moe.

00:14:02.450 --> 00:14:04.810
Huh?! What did you just say?!

00:14:04.810 --> 00:14:06.830
And open your damn eyes!

00:14:06.830 --> 00:14:09.590
Thanks to you, they totally 
think I'm a weakling!

00:14:09.590 --> 00:14:11.780
You'd better get with the program!

00:14:11.780 --> 00:14:15.690
Shijo from the Boxing Club and 
Sakaki from the Kendo Club!

00:14:15.690 --> 00:14:20.040
The rumors that those two were part 
of the 6 Holy Knights were true!

00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:24.630
Huh? What? So you people are 
two of the 6 Holy Knights?

00:14:25.670 --> 00:14:27.330
Don't let down your guard.

00:14:27.330 --> 00:14:29.180
The both of them are very skilled.

00:14:29.180 --> 00:14:31.230
Especially the one with the long hair.

00:14:31.950 --> 00:14:35.940
Crap... He's not someone you 
could easily escape from.

00:14:35.940 --> 00:14:38.940
And if we lay hands on them, 
the both of us are expelled.

00:14:39.200 --> 00:14:41.570
How about them, Baby Beel?

00:14:43.440 --> 00:14:47.860
Yeah... I guess they have to show you how 
strong and smart they are, don't they?

00:14:47.860 --> 00:14:50.880
No... He doesn't understand at all.

00:14:50.880 --> 00:14:52.570
I have to do something.

00:14:53.550 --> 00:14:57.870
What do you want? We just came 
to see some acquaintances.

00:14:57.870 --> 00:15:00.220
You might be some 6 Holy Knights or whatever,

00:15:00.220 --> 00:15:03.230
but it's not like you'd be violent 
with people unprovoked, right?

00:15:05.100 --> 00:15:09.170
On the contrary, Miss. I'm 
afraid you are mistaken.

00:15:10.600 --> 00:15:13.410
What we are about to do is not violence.

00:15:14.420 --> 00:15:15.680
It is sanctioning.

00:15:22.530 --> 00:15:23.940
With a wooden sword?

00:15:23.940 --> 00:15:27.070
Oh? She dodged it?

00:15:27.070 --> 00:15:28.660
Did something just happen?

00:15:28.660 --> 00:15:30.150
I-I can't tell...

00:15:30.150 --> 00:15:32.160
K-Kunieda-senpai!

00:15:37.620 --> 00:15:40.400
Azusa-chan, do you have a ruler or something?

00:15:46.840 --> 00:15:49.210
Wait, seriously? With that?

00:15:49.210 --> 00:15:51.010
She's fighting one of the 6 Holy Knights!

00:15:51.010 --> 00:15:52.340
She's gonna get killed!

00:15:52.340 --> 00:15:58.170
Impossible. The sword strike of 
a master is faster than 250 km/h.

00:15:58.170 --> 00:16:00.950
If you use something like that to parry a blow

00:16:00.950 --> 00:16:04.980
from the kendo captain, 
Sakaki, it won't be pretty.

00:16:08.040 --> 00:16:08.950
Get on with it.

00:16:24.250 --> 00:16:26.380
Incredibly... moe...

00:16:26.790 --> 00:16:29.790
This woman sure is something...

00:16:29.790 --> 00:16:32.130
And so incredibly fast!

00:16:35.820 --> 00:16:38.010
You're amazing, Kunieda-senpai!

00:16:40.960 --> 00:16:45.180
I see. Perhaps I underestimated you.

00:16:45.700 --> 00:16:47.480
Let's be serious about this.

00:16:47.480 --> 00:16:50.480
Oh? Finally my turn, huh?

00:16:53.500 --> 00:16:55.200
What are you doing?

00:16:56.330 --> 00:16:58.530
Put down that baby on your back.

00:16:58.530 --> 00:17:01.200
Even though I am a genius,

00:17:01.200 --> 00:17:06.540
it would be difficult for me to defeat 
you without traumatizing that baby.

00:17:06.540 --> 00:17:08.450
Don't worry 'bout him.

00:17:08.450 --> 00:17:12.100
He might not look it, but he's pretty gutsy.

00:17:14.430 --> 00:17:16.800
No wonder they call you the BoB Brawler.

00:17:16.800 --> 00:17:19.880
Then I will proceed without hesitation!

00:17:20.640 --> 00:17:23.290
Show me everything you've got!

00:17:23.850 --> 00:17:26.810
You'd better prove that 
you're smarter than me!

00:17:26.810 --> 00:17:29.400
Hold it! If you fight, you'll be expelled!

00:17:29.400 --> 00:17:30.770
Question...

00:17:31.980 --> 00:17:33.920
...number 1!

00:17:33.920 --> 00:17:37.280
A grandma and grandpa are in a certain place!

00:17:37.280 --> 00:17:40.200
Answer me this: Which one is stronger?

00:17:44.660 --> 00:17:46.180
It's over.

00:17:49.620 --> 00:17:50.500
Oga?

00:17:50.500 --> 00:17:52.080
Why did he quiz him?

00:17:52.080 --> 00:17:54.310
I don't get how O-shi-yama does things...

00:17:54.310 --> 00:17:56.260
I don't know the answer, either.

00:17:57.900 --> 00:17:58.970
Brother!

00:17:59.990 --> 00:18:02.000
Brother, what are you doing?

00:18:02.000 --> 00:18:04.670
Taking a direct blow from Shinjo-senpai?

00:18:04.670 --> 00:18:07.070
How self-destructive could you be?!

00:18:07.410 --> 00:18:08.900
Hold it there.

00:18:09.150 --> 00:18:11.320
He hasn't lost yet.

00:18:12.380 --> 00:18:16.150
No, it's over, Miss.

00:18:16.770 --> 00:18:18.240
Definitely...

00:18:18.540 --> 00:18:24.210
Shinjo-senpai has ended every boxing 
match he's ever had with a one-punch KO.

00:18:24.210 --> 00:18:26.500
And he has the second-best 
record in the entire country.

00:18:26.500 --> 00:18:29.290
I don't care who you are, 
if you take a direct hit...

00:18:29.290 --> 00:18:30.580
Well then...

00:18:31.280 --> 00:18:32.690
0 points.

00:18:37.550 --> 00:18:38.680
Oga!

00:18:38.680 --> 00:18:39.800
Brother!

00:18:39.800 --> 00:18:41.290
What did you just...

00:18:41.680 --> 00:18:48.560
Idiots who can't answer my questions 
get 0 points, you bastard.

00:18:49.920 --> 00:18:51.810
I'm somewhat shocked.

00:18:52.940 --> 00:18:56.570
Don't worry. I'll give you another chance.

00:18:56.570 --> 00:18:58.720
Answer it carefully...

00:18:58.720 --> 00:19:01.070
Once upon a time...

00:19:02.870 --> 00:19:06.180
...there was a...

00:19:08.990 --> 00:19:10.230
Oga!

00:19:10.230 --> 00:19:13.360
Sorry... Can you hold him a second?

00:19:13.600 --> 00:19:15.500
I can't dodge his punches very well.

00:19:18.510 --> 00:19:21.650
You think it's the baby's 
fault you can't dodge them?

00:19:21.650 --> 00:19:26.270
Fool. It is impossible for an amateur 
like you to dodge a boxer's punches.

00:19:26.500 --> 00:19:28.050
He's right!

00:19:28.050 --> 00:19:30.250
And besides, if you fight back...

00:19:30.250 --> 00:19:31.520
I ain't going to.

00:19:31.520 --> 00:19:32.730
Anyway...

00:19:33.060 --> 00:19:36.030
Do <i>not</i> get any farther 
than 15 meters from me.

00:19:38.150 --> 00:19:39.380
"Don't go away from me?"

00:19:39.840 --> 00:19:41.820
In other words... "Stay by my side?"

00:19:41.820 --> 00:19:43.700
"Will you stay by my side?"

00:19:43.700 --> 00:19:46.570
"Together, forever?" "Be with 
me the rest of my life?!"

00:19:47.870 --> 00:19:51.550
No way! I'm not emotionally prepared for...

00:19:51.550 --> 00:19:52.470
Roger.

00:19:56.340 --> 00:19:59.360
Okay, Captain! It's your final chance!

00:19:59.360 --> 00:20:01.550
Don't disappoint me now!

00:20:01.550 --> 00:20:04.700
That's my line!

00:20:06.390 --> 00:20:08.140
The final question:

00:20:08.140 --> 00:20:09.520
When is a door...

00:20:13.990 --> 00:20:16.030
...not a door?

00:20:24.170 --> 00:20:26.480
W-When it's ajar?

00:20:27.700 --> 00:20:29.460
What?!

00:20:29.460 --> 00:20:31.650
H-How did he know?!

00:20:31.650 --> 00:20:33.070
Are you a genius?!

00:20:33.660 --> 00:20:36.590
Look, Baby Beel! He really is smart!

00:20:36.590 --> 00:20:39.840
He's pretty strong, too! He 
wouldn't be a problem, right?

00:20:43.690 --> 00:20:44.970
He's friggin' asleep!

00:20:45.380 --> 00:20:48.460
Why?! What does he lack?

00:20:48.460 --> 00:20:50.650
Hey, keep it down!

00:20:50.650 --> 00:20:53.220
You're going to wake him after 
he finally went to sleep!

00:20:53.220 --> 00:20:55.850
I give up. I have lost interest.

00:20:56.580 --> 00:20:59.360
My fists will hurt if I continue on.

00:20:59.360 --> 00:21:02.850
And besides, we were just supposed 
to test the waters today.

00:21:08.060 --> 00:21:12.120
Until the next time... With Miki-kun.

00:21:15.110 --> 00:21:16.580
Miki?

00:21:19.330 --> 00:21:22.460
Oga-san! Kunieda-senpai!

00:21:22.460 --> 00:21:24.270
I'm so glad you're okay!

00:21:24.270 --> 00:21:26.340
I didn't know what was gonna 
happen for a bit there!

00:21:26.590 --> 00:21:28.870
But you sure were impressive, Brother!

00:21:28.870 --> 00:21:34.100
You must have sealed your secret 800 volt 
attack because it was too dangerous, right?

00:21:34.100 --> 00:21:37.320
To sympathize with your opponent like that...

00:21:37.320 --> 00:21:38.900
I respect you more and more!

00:21:46.550 --> 00:21:48.050
Those are the 6 Holy Knights...

00:21:48.350 --> 00:21:51.450
Usually they would be suspended from 
entering competitions for something like this.

00:21:51.800 --> 00:21:54.230
Attacking us out in the open like that?

00:21:54.820 --> 00:21:57.820
I guess they really are 
sanctioned by the school...

00:21:58.200 --> 00:21:59.670
Doesn't it worry you too, Oga?

00:21:59.670 --> 00:22:02.080
Yeah, it's just as I thought...

00:22:02.080 --> 00:22:03.280
Indeed.

00:22:03.750 --> 00:22:05.920
He really does like you.

00:22:08.680 --> 00:22:11.180
Come on already, why don't you be his mother?

00:22:13.480 --> 00:22:18.930
Now is not the time!

00:24:01.800 --> 00:24:05.460
Only 3 of the 6 Holy Knights 
have shown themselves.

00:24:05.460 --> 00:24:07.140
Where are the other 4?

00:24:07.140 --> 00:24:09.420
6 minus 3 is 3, damn it!

00:24:09.420 --> 00:24:11.680
What's black and white and red all over?

00:24:11.680 --> 00:24:13.090
Are you still going on with that?

00:24:13.090 --> 00:24:14.980
What can you put on, but never take off?

00:24:14.980 --> 00:24:16.220
Demon World Briefs!

00:24:16.470 --> 00:24:19.280
What can you only see with your eyes closed?

00:24:19.280 --> 00:24:21.640
Hilda-san's swimsuit that I 
can only see in my dreams!

00:24:21.640 --> 00:24:22.900
On the next Beelzebub:

00:24:23.150 --> 00:24:25.150
Who Could the 6 Holy Knights Be?

00:24:25.150 --> 00:24:27.220
I will become the Riddle King!

00:24:27.220 --> 00:24:28.210
I suck at impressions!
